# Boxes are compared for equality but not ordered: s_ort needs Ord.
== SOURCE
s_ort "b" "a"
== ERROR
error[type-mismatch]: expected a number or Char, found Box Char
 --> -e:1:1
  |
1 | s_ort "b" "a"
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  |       ------- this is a Box Char
  = note: `s_ort` has type Ord a => a -> a
  = help: `d_isclose b` opens a box to get the value inside
